{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「餓狼傳說CotW」新角色「拉奧」將於11月19日加入！自劇場版動畫首次登場歷經32年，終於登上遊戲\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4ed94fcde9bacc60f74300e940608227530afb99e94a1a14b0985ee7161ea67c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feb06ebf8730185c509f45e5320da1a05.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「餓狼傳說CotW」新角色「拉奧」將於11月19日加入！自劇場版動畫首次登場歷經32年，終於登上遊戲</figcaption></figure><p>株式會社SNK的對戰格鬥遊戲「<strong>餓狼傳說 City of the Wolves</strong>」(以下稱餓狼傳說CotW)中，Season Pass 3 DLC角色第5彈「<strong>拉奧・高迪亞姆斯</strong>」(以下稱拉奧)將自 2026年11月19日(四) 起加入。<br/>在此之前，已公開角色預告片。</p><h2>追求「戰神之鬥衣」的強敵「拉奧」將於11月19日起加入！</h2><figure><img alt=\"追求「戰神之鬥衣」的強敵「拉奧」\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6ce2db3556cada32f6c247b9025bff5fcb5785d8d2c3542b48439c327124dc17/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdc3a7df83376ed20902430b3898a5caa.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>追求「戰神之鬥衣」的強敵「拉奧」</figcaption></figure><p>拉奧是首次登場於1994年公開的劇場版動畫「<strong>餓狼傳說 -THE MOTION PICTURE-</strong>」的角色。<br/>劇中圍繞據說寄宿著鬥神之力的「戰神之鬥衣」，與泰瑞展開激戰。</p><p></p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5c7850d94193aed84e96a5244cb781077a997580e0165aba0b6e0512c29d7354/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F24d03612a02b8072befe1315a8f49a8d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7136c5bf2e02ce5d863f457baf60db9a25cba7e226f1401c446b792af51cc994/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7cf1a36c7db08bc19e7c117b893e3183.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>然而，或許因為是動畫原創角色，至今未曾登場於餓狼傳說遊戲本篇。<br/>這樣的拉奧，竟跨越<strong>32年時光</strong>，終於以可遊玩角色身分加入。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><blockquote><p></p><p>32年前に僕が監督・キャラクターデザイン・総作画監督を手掛けた劇場用作品‥</p><p>そのオリジナルキャラクターであるラオコーン・ゴーダマスがプレイアブルキャラクターとして遂に配信されます❗️</p><p>皆さま是非、ご期待ください‼️ <a href=\"https://t.co/EolYuYLfGk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/EolYuYLfGk</a><a href=\"https://t.co/iNon64SM55\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/iNon64SM55</a></p><p>— 大張正己 /Masami Obari (@G1_BARI) <a href=\"https://x.com/G1_BARI/status/2120884762768494971?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 12, 2026</a></p></blockquote><p>擔任劇場版動畫導演的大張正己氏(<a href=\"https://x.com/G1_BARI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@G1_BARI</a>)也對這項發表做出反應。<br/>在SNS投稿了\"<a href=\"https://x.com/G1_BARI/status/2120887509861466173\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">太過期待，全身細胞都要爆炸了</a>\"這般的喜悅評論。</p><h3>角色預告片也公開！</h3><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>角色預告片於SNK官方YouTube頻道以<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RWkMqE78o_c\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日語</a>與<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7mnwl9BV7vw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">英語</a>發布。<br/>日語配音由與劇場版動畫相同的<strong>三木眞一郎</strong>氏(<a href=\"https://x.com/miki_shin318\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@miki_shin318</a>)繼續擔任。<br/>英語配音則起用<strong>Branden Loera</strong>氏(<a href=\"https://x.com/BrandLoVO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@BrandLoVO</a>)。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-07.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/240a15f01c59d7b52288633e3539243f4b8e87051ee5517a9ac0f977bc5a08a2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F432b1d38891200cbce88db3518213c6b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/99211ca4793800a1617284f62948a301203d6e58cf8b23020c352b0bb6a69c16/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F17091b06db99b2bfc9fa7cfb61fae723.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/833e1f6af0419d7b9fc9f2d717d1763c2fb88505215d6862ddb466ee24c65323/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa2d03951884d34c2de668b6771a5fc69.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/78800fd97e3ab2deba77d6026c4aa6d1d747c6f96106a0366eb353a498693c97/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9f0626105a211fd692befac716890931.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><figure><img alt=\"解開最後的封印吧\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0949f92813896d9cb7f2633d00dcdce1bc593e0a6da2dac7171b0d7e4a3895ba/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F66f975f29ff6bea389a0dcd4cca4dc53.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>解開最後的封印吧</figcaption></figure><p>PV中描繪了纏繞紅色氣場的拉奧戰鬥場景。<br/>更披露了劇場版動畫中也登場的部下們，以及穿上所有戰神之鬥衣的「金屬拉奧」姿態。<br/>劇中展現的打扮與強大，在遊戲內會如何描繪。<br/>會展開什麼樣的戰鬥風格。<br/>請確認其端倪。</p><h3>「EOST MODE」與「ARCADE MODE」也追加拉奧的故事！</h3><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-10.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6b460201f66e24150d0cb165ee2534079afa423f558e4647f5359f0984463468/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F91dfc1374dbe2058e0c4cc7d46905e16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/fatalfury-cotw-laocorn-release-date-announcement-11.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4461c6aa506c7e035a65a401cc553518752e4004810a1fc95869848222d3954d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcd19d4ce37b1697a6c4cfb6d68fc8380.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><figure><img alt=\"拉奧的故事\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bab25db87e7130cbcd5690d4d05b6f54ddad1989c9ae23df374185fed834e7d6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa040c9578b3e9ec1db1ecdf6e62a4c57.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>拉奧的故事</figcaption></figure><p>可享受各角色故事的「EOST MODE」與「ARCADE MODE」也將新追加拉奧的故事。</p><p>餓狼傳說CotW中的拉奧，似乎也為了尋求戰神之鬥衣而降臨南鎮。<br/>在獲得最後的鬥衣之後，等待他的命運究竟是什麼。<br/>令人迫不及待發布日呢。</p><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>同時也公開了劇場版動畫的精華影片，可確認劇中拉奧的活躍。<br/>因本作而認識拉奧的人，也請務必觀看。</p><p>拉奧的詳情可於官方網站的角色頁面及預告片確認。<br/>也請一併查看<a href=\"https://www.snk-corp.co.jp/official/fatalfury-cotw/characters/laocorn.php\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">餓狼傳說CotW官方網站</a>。</p><h2>期間限定75%OFF特賣也舉辦中！</h2><figure><img alt=\"期間限定特賣中！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ff1e5f7046425cd17a6b774c8ebc36dedb30523e8789f8897450d3013aad8a02/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2ef5fedf7ade4df744419e4ea4f0b6a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>期間限定特賣中！</figcaption></figure><p>正舉辦以「<strong>餓狼傳說 City of the Wolves Standard Edition</strong>」為對象的特賣。<br/>期間限定，可以驚人的 75%OFF的745日圓(含稅) 購買。</p><p>此外Season Pass 1為 33%OFF的991日圓(含稅) 。<br/>Season Pass 2也為 20%OFF的1,584日圓(含稅) 。</p><p>不妨趁此機會，入手餓狼傳說CotW吧！？</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2492040/_City_of_the_Wolves/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Steam</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/garou-city-of-the-wolves-556c5a\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games Store</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://store.playstation.com/ja-jp/product/JP0576-PPSA19359_00-PS5JPGAROU07COTW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Store</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.xbox.com/ja-JP/games/store/city-of-the-wolves/9p9m35wvgck9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Store</a></p></li></ul><figure><img alt=\"Season Pass 3也與「東京復仇者」及「鐵拳」合作！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/42ed721592c0671a2cd5f529cf963f62349763425ade22fa013c0bdeeb126970/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F103a72c30287dcc48a03844b5b9e5762.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Season Pass 3也與「東京復仇者」及「鐵拳」合作！</figcaption></figure><p>實施眾多合作等，今後發展也備受矚目的餓狼傳說CotW。<br/>後續報導請於<a href=\"https://www.snk-corp.co.jp/official/fatalfury-cotw/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">餓狼傳說CotW官方網站</a>或官方X(<a href=\"https://x.com/GAROU_PR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@GAROU_PR</a>)確認。</p><figure><img alt=\"超越時光・・・超越人類・・・而今，成為神！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9e0db795251aa89ef8567fcc6255022075a9b96d78d1a274d6310e86622f96e5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc54af3820e1d720414f786f1b238f62c.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>超越時光・・・超越人類・・・而今，成為神！</figcaption></figure><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/fatalfury-cotw-streamer-cup-nov2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「餓狼傳說 CotW STREAMER CUP」將於11月7日舉辦！GO1、Nemo等人氣實況主20名參加</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/interview/snk-osaka-office-tour/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸【SNK開發工作室參觀】從獎盃、金氏世界紀錄證書到動態捕捉攝影棚！深入探訪SNK大阪總公司</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/fatalfury-cotw-tokyo-revengers-collaboration-dlc-available/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「餓狼傳說 CotW」中東京卍會最強搭檔登場！Mikey＆Draken聯名DLC開始發布</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/fatalfury-cotw-nintendo-switch2-edition/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「餓狼傳說 CotW」Nintendo Switch 2版發售！收錄至Season Pass 3的Starter Edition也登場</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/kujico-nakoruru-rimururu-collection-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Kujico線上抽「SNK 娜可露露＆莉姆露露收藏系列」將於10月23日發售！推出掛軸、BIG 壓克力立牌等周邊商品</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:11.036090+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1822,"images":15,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:23.952732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:40.600603+00:00","content_hash":"46535a4b96b1bf9a2c162d34c8ba9cbcf4eda4ff4feb369391ab28f2fe18600f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}